{"kind":"stack","id":"skeleton-muscles","title":"Skeletons and muscles: support, protection and movement","theme":{"background":"#f4f9f4","foreground":"#1f2d1f","font":"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-q","content":"What is the job of a skeleton?"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-a","label":"To support and protect the body","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"To make the body glow in the dark","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-c","label":"To store water for the body","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-term","content":"Skeleton"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-expl","content":"The bones inside an animal's body. They hold the body up and protect the organs."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which body part does a muscle join to a bone?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"A tendon","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"A feather","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"A shell","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"You are hiking and see a steep rocky path. Which way do you go?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Take the steep rocky path","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Take the flat path by the river","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"You climb carefully. Your legs and arms pull and push hard. Your skeleton keeps you steady and strong."},{"type":"button","id":"c5-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You walk along the river. Your muscles move your legs smoothly, and your bones protect your organs as you go."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-q","content":"Which part of the body protects the heart and lungs?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"The ribcage","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"The kneecap","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-c","label":"The eyebrow","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
